    {
      "name": "RAG Ingestion",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Upload — POST /v1/rag-ingestion/documents",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Single PDF",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/rag-ingestion/documents",
                  "host": [
                    "{{base_url}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "v1",
                    "rag-ingestion",
                    "documents"
                  ]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "formdata",
                  "formdata": [
                    {
                      "key": "files",
                      "type": "file",
                      "src": "{{kb_docs_dir}}/JPMC Healthcare Benefits.pdf"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "description": "Uploads one PDF and indexes it immediately in the same call (Phase 26 - chunk, embed, write to the vector store, all in one request, no separate /index step). On success, this request's Tests script auto-saves results[0].document_id into the document_id collection variable - the List/Get/Delete folder picks it up automatically. results[0] now also reports the indexing outcome: action (insert/update), chunks_indexed, chunks_removed."
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "// Auto-saves the new document_id so you do not have to copy it by hand.",
                      "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                      "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                      "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"document_id\", body.results[0].document_id);",
                      "    console.log(\"document_id set to:\", body.results[0].document_id);",
                      "}"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "Re-upload identical content (duplicate detection, Phase 16)",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/rag-ingestion/documents",
                  "host": [
                    "{{base_url}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "v1",
                    "rag-ingestion",
                    "documents"
                  ]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "formdata",
                  "formdata": [
                    {
                      "key": "files",
                      "type": "file",
                      "src": "{{kb_docs_dir}}/JPMC Healthcare Benefits.pdf"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "description": "Run \"Single PDF\" first, then this request (same file, byte-identical content) - content-hash duplicate detection (Phase 16, reinstated 2026-09-14) means this second upload is NOT stored as a new document: expect 200, uploaded_count: 0, duplicate_count: 1, results[0].status: \"duplicate\", and the SAME document_id as the first upload (not a new one), with message naming which existing document it matched. Uploading the same content under a different filename is still a duplicate - byte content is what's hashed, not the name. The Idempotency-Key header cache is a separate, still-removed mechanism (see docs/BACKLOG.md) - this is specifically about content-hash detection."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Batch, two valid PDFs",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/rag-ingestion/documents",
