                "body": {
                  "mode": "formdata",
                  "formdata": [
                    {
                      "key": "files",
                      "type": "file",
                      "src": "{{kb_docs_dir}}/JPMC Guild Tuition Assistance.pdf"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "supersedes_document_id",
                      "type": "text",
                      "value": "{{document_id}}"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "description": "Set the document_id variable to an existing (ideally already-indexed) document first. Only valid with exactly one file (422 on a batch) and only if the target id exists (per-file \"rejected\" otherwise). Phase 26: this upload indexes immediately in the same call, so the old document is flipped to is_current=false as part of THIS request, not a separate step - check the old document afterward (List/Get/Delete folder) to see is_current go false and superseded_by get set; a Query request should then only ever cite the new document."
              }
            }
          ]
